#instructions
  .container
    .overview
      h3 Whats in the Kit?
      ul
        li
          a href="/" title="cli" Nitro CLI
          |  - our CLI tool for managing your project's infrastructure and services

    .installs
      .apple
        h3 Mac OS X
        ol
          li Download and run the Nitrous.IO Command Line Interface (CLI) Installer Package for OS X.
          li In Terminal, type nitro login and enter your Nitrous.IO username and password.

      .windows
        h3 Windows
        ol
          li Download and run the Nitrous.IO Installer Package for Windows.

      .linux
        h3 Debian/Ubuntu

        ol
          li
            | Add the ______ repository key to your local keychain.
            pre
              code sudo apt-key adv --recv-keys --keyserver keyserver.ubuntu.com 6B19EAE0

            p Then, add the ______ repository to your apt-sources list.
            pre
              code echo "deb https://get.nitrous.io nitrous main" | sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/nitrous.list

          li
            | Update and install the Nitrous.IO Command Line Interface (CLI)
            pre
              code sudo apt-get update
            pre
              code sudo apt-get install -yq nitro

          li Type nitro login and enter your username and password.


      h3 Getting started
      p Once you've installed the kit, you'll have access to the `nitro` command from the command line. Log in using the email address and password you used when creating your Nitrous  account:

      pre
        code
          |
            $ nitro login
            Enter your Nitrous credentials.
            Email: adam@example.com
            Password:
            Could not find an existing public key.
            Would you like to generate one? [Yn]
            Generating new SSH public key.
            Uploading ssh public key /Users/adam/.ssh/id_rsa.pub
            You're now ready to create your first Nitrous app:

      pre
        code
          |
            $ nitro host create
            Creating didactic-frog-357... done.

    h3 More Information

    p
      ' For more information and complete documentation, please consult:
      a href="http://docs.nitrous.io/nitrouskit" http://docs.nitrous.io/nitrouskit

